WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:31.750
This is the final battle!

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:34.160
Galzzly Bear Axe!

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:37.120
Go Shoot!

00:01:40.430 --> 00:01:41.920
Grab my hand!

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:43.810
I...

00:01:51.070 --> 00:01:56.070
Borg's Assault!

00:01:59.910 --> 00:02:00.970
That's right...

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:03.820
I have unfinished business to tend to.

00:02:07.240 --> 00:02:09.640
<i>Important</i> unfinished business.

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:16.120
Still unable to locate him?

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:19.290
I'm trying, but he suddenly went off the radar...

00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:22.510
Damn you, Kai. Trying to be sly with me...

00:02:23.010 --> 00:02:25.390
Do whatever it takes to find him!

00:02:25.390 --> 00:02:27.270
Who is it that you're looking for?

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:29.920
If it's me, I'm right here.

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:31.000
Kai!

00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:32.920
Calm down!

00:02:33.910 --> 00:02:35.440
I'm here to return something.

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:37.190
This, right here.

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:38.660
Return it?

00:02:38.660 --> 00:02:40.210
I see.

00:02:40.210 --> 00:02:42.240
Then I take it that you've lost?

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:45.390
In other words, you no longer have
the right to use Black Dranzer.

00:02:46.630 --> 00:02:48.440
It doesn't matter what you say!

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:49.910
I'll return it, and then some!

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:51.120
Take it back!

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:04.820
Switching to backup systems!

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:07.080
Our security systems aren't activating!

00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:09.330
Training systems are down!

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:12.160
Now we're even, you bastards.

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:13.530
See ya.

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:15.210
Halt!

00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:15.960
Let him go!

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:20.480
I have no need for anyone
who would turn their back on Borg!

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:23.860
More importantly, get our
systems back online at once!

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:24.930
Yes, sir!

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:33.270
Kai has escaped?

00:03:33.550 --> 00:03:35.740
I let him go.

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:41.330
Anyone who would have mere friendship
change their minds is unfit for Borg!

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:43.340
He's no longer of use to us.

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:45.370
Watch your tongue.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:51.380
Regardless, I suggest to not rely on your
grandson when moving forward with our plan.

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:54.940
What say you?

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:57.340
Do as you will. However...

00:03:57.340 --> 00:03:59.150
if you are to fail again...

00:03:59.150 --> 00:04:00.940
I'm sure you know the consequences.

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:03.330
As you wish.

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:20.260
Now!

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:54.280
Boys, our time has come!

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:58.610
While you may be the strongest
in Russia—nay, the world—

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:04.080
up until now, you have been barred
from a chance to make use of that strength!

00:05:04.760 --> 00:05:06.790
Our recent Ceremony

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:11.950
served no purpose other than to test less
than one-tenth of Yuriy and Ivan's power!

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:17.720
But the time for you to use
that power freely has come!

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:20.120
As soon as our systems are back online,

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:22.060
we will rise!

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:26.510
Repeat after me!
When we descend upon the world...

00:05:27.080 --> 00:05:30.180
When we descend upon the world...

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:36.280
when Borg turns the world on its head...

00:05:36.490 --> 00:05:39.980
and when the world bows before Borg...

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:43.360
when the world bows before Borg...

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:45.970
Borg will rule the world!

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:53.840
Cheers!

00:05:54.090 --> 00:05:56.280
Welcome back, Kai!

00:05:56.850 --> 00:06:00.030
I'm so glad you're back on our side!

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:03.330
<i>Yes!</i> I didn't know what we
were gonna do for a while, there.

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:08.730
I wouldn't want to play in the
Finals knowing you'd be against us.

00:06:08.730 --> 00:06:14.560
Kai's being temporarily against us
may have been for the best.

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:16.820
What d'you mean by that, Professor?

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:20.880
While we've always worked together as a team,

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:24.150
there has always been a wall
between Kai and the rest of us.

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:28.170
Thanks to this latest development,
we've finally been able to tear it down.

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:32.280
As of now, Kai has become
a true member of the BBA Team!

00:06:32.610 --> 00:06:39.260
That's true. We finally stand as
a team, right in time for the Finals.

00:06:39.470 --> 00:06:43.800
Which is exactly why we can't let
the Russian team get away with this!

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:46.770
Dragging Kai over to their side is a low blow!

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:50.540
Yeah. <i>Really</i>, who the heck are those guys?

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:53.800
Volkov said something about
a Porg or Borz or something...

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:55.630
Borg.

00:06:56.030 --> 00:07:00.320
They're an evil organization aiming to
take over the world with the power of Beys.

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:05.780
You guys saw the secret base
built under the Abbey, didn't you?

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:10.260
They conduct secret experiments and training,

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:13.420
slowly developing plans for world domination.

00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:19.470
They lure in kids who love Beyblade
from all over the world with their lies,

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:23.370
and subject them to hellish training in the base.

00:07:24.050 --> 00:07:27.250
They only teach the kids there one thing:

00:07:27.560 --> 00:07:29.290
A fear of losing.

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:31.950
Losers and failures have no future—

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:35.050
children who go under such extreme training

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:40.190
lose their humanity and become
mere machines at Volkov's bidding.

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:43.600
But Volkov didn't stop there.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:48.080
They need the Sacred Beasts'
power to control the world.

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:53.470
They organized research teams
to develop artificial Sacred Beasts.

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:59.230
Fearsome artificial Sacred Beasts made from
capturing, absorbing, and fusing real ones.

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:08.030
Only the top members of Borg have
access to these artificial Sacred Beasts.

00:08:08.350 --> 00:08:10.260
That's who they are.

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:14.160
The Russian team was formed
to obtain the real Sacred Beasts.

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:16.220
They're the ultimate Sacred Beast hunters.

00:08:16.490 --> 00:08:18.970
The ultimate Sacred Beast hunters...

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:20.650
Artificial Sacred Beasts...

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:27.100
So, like Black Dranzer, do their Beys have
artificial Sacred Beasts inside of them?

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:31.080
Looks like we picked on one heck of an opponent...

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:36.370
Hey, Kai. Can I ask you something?

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:38.830
Volkov said it earlier.

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:43.600
That a long time ago, you were
trained there as a member of Borg.

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:45.210
That's the truth.

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:47.480
B-But how?!

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:50.460
How'd you end up there in the first place?

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:56.720
I'll explain everything from here.

00:08:57.420 --> 00:08:58.740
Chairman Daitenji!

00:08:58.740 --> 00:08:59.480
Grandpa!

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:02.800
Sorry I'm late.

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:06.650
I got caught up in preparing for the Finals.

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:09.910
It's almost time, Takao! I came from Japan to give you some good vibes!

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:12.240
Grandpa...

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:14.240
What's the matter?

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:15.620
Go home!

00:09:17.090 --> 00:09:19.460
Who do you think you are, telling me to go home?

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:22.660
Send your good vibes packing!
They're a pain in the butt!

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:24.840
It's embarrassing, and gonna get me all nervous!

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:27.080
How could you say such a thing?!

00:09:27.260 --> 00:09:29.080
Show some damn respect!

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:30.160
Repent!

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:43.410
I see you boys have gone through
some tough times in my absence.

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:47.530
I have no doubt about your bonds as the BBA.

00:09:47.870 --> 00:09:50.900
Forget about that, hurry up and get to the explanation!

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:52.980
Why did Kai train at Borg..?

00:09:55.940 --> 00:10:00.670
What I'm about to say goes beyond just Kai.

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:03.120
This involves all of you.

00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:08.870
Namely, why you four competed in the
World Championships as the BBA Team,

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:11.140
and why you're all gathered here today.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:15.040
T-That sounds kinda heavy...

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:19.270
Actually, I brought along someone
better suited to explain the current situation.

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:21.560
Come in.

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:29.170
Dad!

00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:32.650
Right... he <i>was</i> the one
on the videotape back then.

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:35.450
Good to see you again, Takao.

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:40.970
What's the matter, Takao?
You haven't seen your dad in ages.

00:10:40.970 --> 00:10:43.660
Don't hold back.
Give your Dad a big ol' hug!

00:10:46.050 --> 00:10:48.570
What are you doing here, Dad?

00:10:48.570 --> 00:10:52.890
Weren't you traveling the world
on an archaeological dig?

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:54.830
That's right.

00:10:54.830 --> 00:10:58.100
Today, I've come to report my findings.

00:10:58.330 --> 00:10:59.890
To my client.

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:02.560
Your client?

00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:04.340
Don't tell me..!

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:05.530
Yes!

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:07.980
No way!

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:21.210
I was commissioned by Chairman Daitenji

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:24.560
to continue my archaeological survey

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:27.850
on the things you call "Sacred Beasts".

00:11:28.070 --> 00:11:30.540
We've learned quite a bit about them.

00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:32.800
Sacred Beasts.

00:11:32.800 --> 00:11:37.020
They are believed to be
mysterious forms of energy

00:11:37.180 --> 00:11:40.450
that take the form of animals.

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:43.100
That mechanism is out of my expertise.

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:49.080
Countless historic relics confirm that Sacred Beasts
have been a part of human history since ancient times.

00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:54.860
I reported every detail of my
study to Chairman Daitenji.

00:11:55.260 --> 00:11:56.920
And then, one day...

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:00.210
Researching Sacred Beasts, I see?

00:12:00.930 --> 00:12:03.580
Taking the form of unknown energy,

00:12:03.770 --> 00:12:06.580
they're one of the biggest mysteries in human history.

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:09.880
A fascinating subject matter indeed.

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:12.410
You... know of them?

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:14.160
Yes. Well,

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:18.170
my field is closer to <i>development</i> as opposed to <i>research</i>.

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:23.280
What do you think?

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:29.060
What if you could artificially
create them with the power of science?

00:12:30.260 --> 00:12:34.650
What if you could use them to obtain
the power of <i>real </i>Sacred Beasts?

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:36.900
I-I would never—

00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:39.590
Merely a rhetorical question.

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:40.900
Rhetorical...

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:45.200
Oh, I seem to have interrupted you.

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:47.410
Please continue.

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:51.920
I had a bad feeling about that.

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:58.140
After conducting further research, I visited
Interpol to learn of the man's background.

00:12:58.480 --> 00:13:01.430
The man you met was Vladimir Volkov.

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:06.930
He's a Russian Beyblade scientist
who is wanted internationally.

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:08.770
T-That's...!

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:12.630
The man shown shaking Volkov's hand

00:13:12.630 --> 00:13:14.980
is a big shot in the Japanese financial world:

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:18.570
Soichirou Hiwatari, president
of Hiwatari Enterprises.

00:13:19.640 --> 00:13:23.120
We're finding ourselves in deeper and deeper trouble.

00:13:23.830 --> 00:13:27.670
While a hunch, I immediately
got in contact with Chairman Daitenji.

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:29.920
Is that so?

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:31.050
Yes.

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:35.370
The power of Sacred Beasts
could open possibilities in every field.

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:39.160
And the fact that Mr. Hiwatari is
after it can only mean one thing—

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:42.300
He plans to take over the world!

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:46.950
We must take precautionary measures immediately.

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:49.930
What a shock..!

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:53.820
I never imagined that the Sacred Beasts
in our Bits had so much power...

00:13:55.030 --> 00:13:58.950
You're the one who sent us the
video of Takao's father in Europe,

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:00.820
weren't you, Chairman Daitenji?

00:14:01.460 --> 00:14:07.260
I wanted you to think about the meaning of
your Sacred Beasts, and who you'll be up against.

00:14:07.380 --> 00:14:08.540
Hold on!

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:11.470
I get the big picture.

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:13.090
But that means

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:15.300
the one who put Kai into Borg's facilities...

00:14:16.280 --> 00:14:18.040
Soichirou Hiwatari.

00:14:18.470 --> 00:14:19.800
My grandfather.

00:14:21.580 --> 00:14:24.610
I was searching for Sacred Beasts,

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:28.030
unaware that I was in the palm of his hand.

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:31.170
I'm sure you all understand now.

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:34.440
For the sake of stopping Mr. Hiwatari and Volkov's plans,

00:14:34.920 --> 00:14:37.390
I held Beybattle tournaments around the world,

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:40.450
and made a team composed of the best Bladers.

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:44.160
A team full of passionate souls and friendship.

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:47.410
That would be you, as the BBA Team.

00:14:49.790 --> 00:14:53.040
Let's all fight against Borg in the World Championships.

00:14:53.610 --> 00:14:54.730
Let's do it.

00:14:54.730 --> 00:14:55.660
Let's get 'em!

00:14:56.010 --> 00:14:57.790
I'm gonna take them down!

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:00.500
We are the BBA Team!

00:15:00.610 --> 00:15:03.210
We'll show them what a team can really do!

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:04.840
Yeah!

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:08.450
Kai...

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:11.000
I can't trust you guys to do this alone.

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:26.550
Dad.

00:15:27.790 --> 00:15:29.900
That was not cool.

00:15:30.020 --> 00:15:34.000
I had no idea you were
friends with Chairman Daitenji.

00:15:35.880 --> 00:15:38.210
It's going to be a tough battle.

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:42.230
I won't lose, no matter who I'm up against.

00:15:43.390 --> 00:15:44.980
We can count on you.

00:15:45.280 --> 00:15:47.470
Good luck in the Finals.

00:15:47.470 --> 00:15:48.890
Leave it to me!

00:15:49.230 --> 00:15:51.380
I'll show you how cool I can be!

00:15:53.240 --> 00:15:54.560
I can't wait!

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:55.150
Yeah!

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:01.960
Electrical systems, all online.

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:03.690
Hydraulics, all online.

00:16:03.950 --> 00:16:06.570
All systems have been repaired!

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:07.820
Rise!

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:38.250
All aboard?

00:16:38.250 --> 00:16:39.110
Yes!

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:45.180
Thank you for riding the BBA Bus.
I'll be your driver today.

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:47.360
Hey, why are <i>you</i> driving?

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:50.720
I got my bus driver's license back in Japan.

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:53.560
Stop and show me your license, then!

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:55.420
Taking off!

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:08.890
Your grandpa is a better driver than I expected.

00:17:08.890 --> 00:17:10.180
He's not bad...

00:17:10.490 --> 00:17:14.050
Let's get a strategy prepared for the Finals!

00:17:14.640 --> 00:17:17.490
Oh yeah, the Finals should be starting soon, huh?

00:17:18.670 --> 00:17:19.270
What the—

00:17:23.990 --> 00:17:24.900
The hell is this?

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:35.670
Hurry on outside, kids!

00:17:40.210 --> 00:17:43.370
W-What the heck? Is this their idea of a joke?

00:17:43.650 --> 00:17:45.460
How rude.

00:17:46.100 --> 00:17:48.340
No... It can't be...

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:57.430
That's..!

00:17:57.840 --> 00:17:58.690
Ivan!

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:03.730
You looking for a fight?

00:18:03.730 --> 00:18:04.850
Then let's go!

00:18:06.460 --> 00:18:08.750
Your Beys are still being repaired...

00:18:09.220 --> 00:18:10.020
Right...

00:18:17.310 --> 00:18:18.750
Are you really...

00:18:28.890 --> 00:18:31.340
Aiming Beys at people is the lowest of the low!

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:32.760
I'll take you on!

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:34.260
<i>Come on</i>, Borg!

00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:43.640
Max! Don't lose to them!

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:46.010
My mom gave me this Draciel Fortress!

00:18:46.010 --> 00:18:47.350
It'll never lose!

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:54.800
Go, Draciel!

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:02.320
Draciel Fortress is impressive!

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:04.000
Go get 'em, Max!

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:05.180
Something's off.

00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:08.330
There's no way Borg's attacks would stop here.

00:19:12.030 --> 00:19:12.790
What?!

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:15.260
It's...

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:17.020
Borg!

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:18.130
Go.

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:24.530
Ganging up on Draciel Fortress
when it's already battling...

00:19:24.740 --> 00:19:25.910
How dirty!

00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:27.410
That's it..!

00:19:28.370 --> 00:19:33.240
They baited Max to steal his
Sacred Beast by aiming at Takao!

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:36.110
Took you a while!

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:39.670
Max! Don't release Genbu!

00:19:39.960 --> 00:19:42.770
Hang in there, Draciel Fortress!

00:19:47.860 --> 00:19:49.700
End it, Sergey.

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:51.780
Voda is Russian for "water"
Voda Impact!

00:19:51.780 --> 00:19:52.890
Voda is Russian for "water"

00:19:57.120 --> 00:19:58.510
That's an...

00:19:58.510 --> 00:19:59.800
artificial Sacred Beast...

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:10.320
Max!!

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:13.440
Hang in there, Max!

00:20:18.490 --> 00:20:26.210
<i>No..!</i>

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:32.110
You jerks!

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:35.070
Volkov!

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:38.490
Well, BBA?

00:20:38.490 --> 00:20:41.350
How does it feel to have a
taste of Borg's <i>real</i> power?

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:45.710
There's still more terror to come.

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:50.480
We'll give you a full taste of how
terrifying Borg can be in the finals!

00:20:50.730 --> 00:20:52.010
G-Get back here!

00:20:52.010 --> 00:20:55.000
We'll be waiting at the Tournament's grounds.

00:20:55.320 --> 00:21:00.050
The Final Tournament is where
Borg will obtain all Sacred Beasts,

00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:03.070
and is where the World shall bow before us!

00:21:06.180 --> 00:21:07.880
They're quite the enemy.

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:11.170
We must do all that we can to foil their plans.

00:21:14.770 --> 00:21:16.050
How can this be..?

00:21:16.690 --> 00:21:20.050
The Draciel Fortress that <i>Mama</i> gave me.

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:25.360
Borg...

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:26.880
You won't get away with this...

00:21:27.090 --> 00:21:30.930
I will never let you
get away with this!!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:58.260 --> 00:23:02.530
According to my analysis, we're all super-duper steamed at Borg!

00:23:02.530 --> 00:23:06.530
The iron knights from so long ago appear before us—

00:23:06.530 --> 00:23:08.840
It's Giancarlo and Oliver!

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:13.000
And someone else swoops
down! Europe's best Blader!

00:23:13.000 --> 00:23:14.540
Ralf Jurgens!

00:23:14.540 --> 00:23:17.660
What? You're going to crush Takao?!

00:23:18.000 --> 00:23:21.000
Next time: Reunion With The Euro Team!

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:24.010
You guys <i>did</i> want to go to the Finals, after all!
